      "versionNonce": 278616188,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775367257330,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A task that is being CURRENTLY executed\nlives on the Call Stack.\n\nConsidering the single thread architecture\nof JS, only one function can reside in STACK.\n\nHowever, it is called STACK because it can\nalso contain nested operations inside that\none function that is being executed.\n\nCall Stack is working with\nLast In First Out Principle (LIFO)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A task that is being CURRENTLY executed\nlives on the Call Stack.\n\nConsidering the single thread architecture\nof JS, only one function can reside in STACK.\n\nHowever, it is called STACK because it can\nalso contain nested operations inside that\none function that is being executed.\n\nCall Stack is working with\nLast In First Out Principle (LIFO)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
